Package: rdz
Title: Versioned Serialization for R Objects
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Pedro", "Baltazar", email = "pedrobtz@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
    person("Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates", role = "cph",
           comment = "Zstandard, bundled in src/vendor/zstd")
  )
Description: Writes and reads R objects using a versioned, block-structured
    container format. The format preserves R serialization semantics while
    adding explicit format identification, length validation, and integrity
    checking.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Copyright: The authors and copyright holders of the bundled Zstandard
    library and Rust crates are listed in file inst/COPYRIGHTS.
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Suggests:
    bench,
    devtools,
    fst,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
LinkingTo:
    zubin,
    zufast
Config/testthat/edition: 3
SystemRequirements: Cargo (>= 1.88.0) (Rust's package manager) and rustc
    (>= 1.88.0), optional: with R 4.5.0 or newer, the Rust reference
    implementation is built when they are available, until the C
    implementation replaces it
Remotes:
    pedrobtz/zubin,
    pedrobtz/zufast
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
